## Files 

# Make data used in all analyses
raw_data.R: Generates individual-level data for plots with the universal tag
and codes for treatments.
  Output: raw_suppformat_rodents.csv

# Make survival histories for each individual on controls
make_survivaldata.R: calculates survival estimates by month for each species.
uses the unique tags in raw_suppformat_rodents.csv to
generate 0,1 capture history for each individual. Uses capture histories to
calculate monthly survival estimates by species. Tests constant survival over time
against varying survival,
  Outputs:
    Capture histories: [species]_captures_all.csv
    Species survivals: [species]period_survival.csv
    compiled survivals across species: regime_survival.csv
    survival dynamics test: [species]survival_AICs.csv
    
# Reproductive activity

# New arrivals (dispersals and births)

newcap.R : uses the first record of a unique ID as the "new arrival" month and
for each month counts the number of first records in each month.
  Output: newcap_data.csv

